# Created transiently when running `napi build` to regenerate the
# committed loader (see the index.js note below). Never committed.
node_modules/

# index.js (the napi-rs multi-platform loader) and index.d.ts are
# COMMITTED, not ignored: they are generated by `@napi-rs/cli@2`
# (`napi build --platform --js-package-name @databricks/databricks-sql-kernel`)
# but the release workflow's build runs @napi-rs/cli@3, which does not
# emit index.js. Committing the generated loader decouples the published
# umbrella from the CLI version. Regenerate + recommit when the napi
# target list or the #[napi] API surface changes.
